Embedded fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
------------------------------------------
This product bundles the following open-source monospace fonts, all licensed
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (full texts in web/public/fonts/LICENSE-*.txt):

- JetBrains Mono — https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono (Reserved Font Name: JetBrains Mono)
- Cascadia Code — https://github.com/microsoft/cascadia-code (Reserved Font Name: Cascadia Code)
- IBM Plex Mono — https://github.com/IBM/plex (Reserved Font Name: IBM Plex Mono)
- Fira Code — https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode (Reserved Font Name: Fira Code)

Per OFL 1.1, the distributed font files keep their original font names
(including Reserved Font Names) and are unmodified.

Additional fonts are installed from npm packages at build time:
- Geist Sans (@fontsource/geist-sans) — SIL OFL 1.1
- Inter (@fontsource/inter) — SIL OFL 1.1
- codicon icon font (bundled inside monaco-editor) — upstream vscode-codicons is CC-BY-4.0

