dsh integration boundary (important)
------------------------------------
Codecombo neither includes nor distributes dsh (DeepSeek Harness). Codecombo
only ships an optional local reverse-proxy/embedding channel: if and only if
the user has installed dsh on their own machine, Codecombo can embed the dsh
web UI over a loopback proxy. No dsh code, binaries, or assets are part of
this repository or of any Codecombo distribution artifact.
